cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ucdpR in research, please cite the package and the UCDP datasets used."
type: software
title: "ucdpR: Access and Work with Uppsala Conflict Data Program Data"
version: 0.7.2
date-released: 2026-11-09
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
authors:
  - family-names: Oswald
    given-names: Christian
    email: christian.oswald@unibw.de
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8291-9544"
    affiliation: "Center for Crisis Early Warning, University of the Bundeswehr Munich"
repository-code: "https://github.com/christianoswald/ucdpR"
url: "https://christianoswald.github.io/ucdpR/"
abstract: >-
  An R toolkit for reproducible access to and research with current and
  historical datasets published by the Uppsala Conflict Data Program. It
  supports discovery, downloading, provenance, validation, version comparison,
  spatial preparation, aggregation, panel construction, and interoperability
  with related peace and conflict research packages.
keywords:
  - R
  - UCDP
  - armed conflict
  - political violence
  - reproducible research
  - conflict data
